  "answer": "The build cylinder’s inner surface is intended to seal against a dynamic ceramic seal [D-023.p1.note.vision]. The system diagram places that seal in the build base’s groove, against the cylinder wall [Zaxis_legend.l07, Zaxis_legend.l06]. The diagram also says the cylinder’s top edge registers the print platform [Zaxis_legend.l03, Zaxis_legend.l04].\n\nThe cylinder drawing’s Ø262,0 H7 and Ø264,0 H7 callouts fail the ISO 286 check, so no precise fit can be inferred from them [D-023.p1.vision.c06, D-023.p1.vision.c07].",
