 "after": {
  "answer": "The build cylinder registers on the Print Platform, according to the Z-axis diagram; its top edge carries the registration surfaces [Zaxis_legend.l03] [Zaxis_legend.l04]. The drawings suggest it fits into the Main Platform’s Ø262,0 H8 bore: the cylinder has a matching Ø262,0 j7 diameter. That mating fit is inferred from the dimensions, not explicitly stated by a source [D-003.p1.vision.c15] [D-023.p1.vision.c06.C-001].\n\nThe cylinder’s j7 callout was corrected by C-001; the original reading was H7 [D-023.p1.vision.c06.C-001] [D-023.p1.vision.c06]. Another cylinder callout, Ø264,0 H7, failed the ISO 286 check and is probably misread, so it is not evidence for the fit [D-023.p1.vision.c07].",
